l4hod: record l4hod, Layer 4 task L4A-58 (the ledger's HO-D under W138's limiter): the peers' in-service test of each supervisor's
TPS2553-1 drafted as record l9t5's apply_gen_sch_b_hodtest.py, composed with W137's canmb, W138's regstage and W143's canen in every order
they admit, its levels, its acceptance, its procedure and detection interval, and its own faults (MESHSAT-1357, W146; a DRAFT, NOT APPLIED;
prototype design, nothing built or measured; it closes no cx46 item and moves no state)

