   anode on its peer's pin with 10 kOhm to that peer's own rail, each peer's 10k over 20k with 10 nF to its ADC pin; nothing else on these
   nets but the third BAT46W from t's regulator EN to the load's bottom; traced from the load to ground: who can start the test; traced from
