7. THE LEVELS on the makers' printed rows (MODEL from PRINTED; assumptions named)
   the switch gates: a peer's high at least 2.8422 V (VDD - 0.4 V at 8 mA, Table 158) through 1 kOhm over 100 kOhm: 2.8141 V,
